699801887_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1BhU_G9j_dEQ7kNvwEU7FtO&_nc_oc=AdpAG14fTk4BDrRRUehFA2IBH9OXD7u3hWcNBXmioiB386VRmDrfupTWnxi7oRGhMK4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7pajSqlpBQCet0qI-GxYFzGt-LaLWwB29kYbRr66xzfA&oe=6A0C7458"}, "display_name": "Im A Rascal", "keywords": ["prank", "Funny", "slap", "fighting", "school"], "long_description": "CAUSE CHAOS IN CLASS\nStep into the role of a mischievous student and turn your classroom upside down! Your main task is simple: disrupt everything and everyone. Throw apples at classmates, prank teachers with funny tricks, and make the classroom a chaotic playground.\n\nFLIP THE CLASSROOM\n\nKnock over desks, throw students and teachers around, and watch the hilarious reactions. From slapping pranks to over-the-top mayhem, nothing is off-limits in your mission to create total disorder.\n{931255579317179}\n\n\nDRINK THE GIANT POTION\n\nGrab the magical potion and watch yourself grow into a towering giant! Smash through desks, lift classmates and teachers.\n\n{1667556514258190}\n\nPURE FUN AND LAUGHTER\nI\u2019m a Rascal! is all about hilarious moments, chaos, and over-the-top mischief. Are you ready to cause mayhem in the classroom? \n\n\n\n{648534651686094}", "short_description": "Step into the chaos as a mischievous student! Throw apples, prank teachers, blast noises, grow huge with magic potions, and toss classmates around. Pure classroom mayhem awaits in I\u2019m a Rascal!"}]}, "developer_name": "JB Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vrprivacy/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "JB Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/vrprivacy/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_t